%% Reprise IDE - fix candidates, draft PR, verification, self-review (v3)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Developer
    participant R as Reprise panel
    participant AI as Provider (stub)
    participant X as CI or runner worktrees
    participant E as Opened folder + diff editor
    participant G as GitHub

    U->>R: Propose fixes for #N (diagnosis accepted)
    loop up to max_rounds (default 3)
        R->>AI: fix x candidates (default 3), with feedback from earlier rounds
        AI-->>R: candidate patches (stub: prepared fixtures)
        R->>R: drop out-of-scope files and duplicate diffs
        opt candidates run locally
            U->>R: approve candidate batch (PD-27)
        end
        R->>X: quick check each candidate in isolation
        X-->>R: repro runs and suite results per candidate
        R->>R: reject still-reproducing and regressing candidates, rank survivors
    end
    R->>E: open diff view of selected candidate
    U->>E: apply, edit or reject
    E-->>R: applied files written to the folder
    R->>G: create reprise/fix-N off current branch via Git Data API, open draft PR with checklist
    R->>X: repro test x required runs, full suite on base and head, reruns for pass-to-fail tests
    X-->>R: outcomes
    R->>R: classify tests, apply verdict precedence
    R->>G: update PR checklist, commit record to reprise-data
    opt FIX_VERIFIED and self_review on
        R->>AI: review (diff, diagnosis, results)
        AI-->>R: findings
        R-->>U: findings, offer a new round or list them in the PR
    end
    U->>R: Mark ready for review
    R->>G: markPullRequestReadyForReview (GraphQL)
    opt reviewers comment on the PR
        U->>R: Address review comments
        R->>R: start a new candidate round with the comments as feedback
    end
